<title>THAILAND: Siam Commercial Bank third quarter net up.</title>
<headline>Siam Commercial Bank third quarter net up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		6.13	vs	   5.09</p>
<p>    Net		    2,333.3	vs	1,993.7</p>
<p>NOTES: Revenues not stated. Full name of Bank is Siam Commercial Bank Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950</p>
</text>
